Scope note: this MIT license covers the build scaffolding in this repository
(the pixi manifest, conda recipe, build.zig and the Zig tools, scripts, tests
and documentation). It does NOT cover R, which is fetched at build time and is
GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only, nor the patches to R in zigbuild/patches/, which
are under R's license. The built packages also include third-party components
(for example cairo, pkgconf, the zig and flang toolchains) whose licenses apply
to the distributed binaries; their texts ship inside the packages.
